00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.020
National debt?

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:13.080
[impotent noises]

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.920
But if somebody kneels at a football game,

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.400
